**Problem.** A few skilling messages differ from OSRS in wording or chat type, so the RuneLite plugins that match them don't react:

- Mining and star mining send "You swing your pickaxe at the rock." RuneLite's Mining plugin matches `You swing your pick at the (?:rock|star|deposit)(?:\.|!)` ([`MiningPlugin`](https://github.com/runelite/runelite/blob/master/runelite-client/src/main/java/net/runelite/client/plugins/mining/MiningPlugin.java)).
- Cooking sends "You successfully cook the Raw shrimps." / "You accidentally burn the Raw shrimps." as game messages. The Cooking plugin only counts `SPAM` messages ([`CookingPlugin.onChatMessage`](https://github.com/runelite/runelite/blob/master/runelite-client/src/main/java/net/runelite/client/plugins/cooking/CookingPlugin.java)), so its session never counts, and the line names the raw item.
- "You remove the cannonballs from the mould." is a game message. The Smelting plugin only reads `SPAM` ([`SmeltingPlugin`](https://github.com/runelite/runelite/blob/master/runelite-client/src/main/java/net/runelite/client/plugins/smelting/SmeltingPlugin.java)).
- Fishing sends "You catch some raw shrimps" (with "raw " and no full stop). Fish barrel trackers read the fish name from that line and look it up without "Raw", e.g. the tictac7x Charges plugin (Plugin Hub): `You catch (a|an|some) (?<fish>.+).?`, matched against "Shrimps", "Karambwan", "Sea turtle"... ([TicTac7x/runelite-plugins](https://github.com/TicTac7x/runelite-plugins), `U_FishBarrel.java`).

**Change.** "You swing your pick at the rock." in `Mining.kt` and `StarMiningScript.kt`; "You catch some shrimps." (no "raw ", full stop) in `Fishing.kt`; the cooking lines name the cooked item in lower case and are `spam`; the cannonball line is `spam`. Text and chat type only.

**Tests.** None added (message text only). The strings and chat types were compared with the plugin sources linked above. Not re-checked in game on this branch.

**Caveats.** The cooking line's article ("the shrimps") was not checked against live for every food; the plugins only match the prefix. `Fishing.kt` is also touched by #346, in other lines. "You retrieve a bar of ..." (smelting) is also `spam` on OSRS; that change is in the Varrock platebody PR, since it touches the same lines.

**Release note.** Mining, fishing, cooking and cannonball messages use the OSRS wording and chat types, so RuneLite's skilling overlays count them.

**Checklist**
- [x] The change compiles (`./gradlew build`).
- [x] Tests related to the change pass (`./gradlew assemble test integration`, `spotlessCheck`).
- [x] No documentation change needed.
- [x] No unrelated formatting or dependency changes.
- [x] Manual testing notes are under Tests above.
